1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,800
Every night, the cue lamp calls one name.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,500
Tonight, it called Nova.

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,500
But the wings were empty.

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,800
The understudy knew the light.

5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,900
Mira walked on.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,000
The crowd never knew.
